<title>USA: CSCE coffee could climb to $3/lb - Merrill's Ganes.</title>
<headline>CSCE coffee could climb to $3/lb - Merrill's Ganes.</headline>
<byline>Wendy Pollack</byline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coffee prices on New York's Coffee, Sugar and Cocoa Exchange (CSCE) could climb as high as $3 per pound in the near-term, Merrill Lynch soft commmodities analyst Judith Ganes said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;You can't rule out any figure,&quot; Ganes said when asked if $3 coffee was on the horizon. &quot;For March and May (futures), the sky is the limit.&quot;</p>
</text>
